        "ActionId": 25,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Hassen",
            "If the School regarded itself as an Ark, then it must be operating on the premise that the rest of the world will be destroyed by some kind of \"flood.\"",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Hassen",
            "In other words, maybe the School went into hiding underground because they believed that the surface couldn't endure the coming disaster.",
